# of defence in case that config line is ever dropped.
AGENTS.md
manifest.md
profile.md
content/
skills/
docs/testing-setup.md
docs/session-log.md
docs/session-handoff.md
docs/framework-issues.md
docs/security-report.md
docs/qa-report.md

