.DS_Store
*.pem
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# Vercel
.vercel

# QA browser artifacts — screenshots of the live app contain real customer data.
# .playwright-mcp/ is ignored above; this catches shots saved to the repo root by
# a filename argument, which is how two of them escaped on 2026-08-17 (SEC-07, H-01).
# Root-anchored: nothing binary or artifact-shaped is tracked anywhere in this
# repo, so a blanket rule at the root costs nothing and closes the whole class.
# The earlier `qa-*.png` / `*.screenshot.png` pair only caught the two filenames
# that happened to leak; `calendar.png`, `trace.har` or `export.csv` still walked
# straight past it (@security L-08).
/*.png
/*.jpg
/*.jpeg
/*.webp
/*.gif
/*.har
/*.csv
/*.log
